      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get the warning but i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and i just feel like i overdid it. if i take the 2000mg now and then just drink some Gatorade with it, won't that basically just balance everything out? it seems like a logical way to speed up recovery so i can just sleep this off. can you just confirm if that's a safe way to handle a massive sweat loss?",
